.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
# The webapps keep tsc's build info outside ./dist (vite would delete it there),
# so exclude it explicitly - it is a local build artifact, and letting it into
# the context would invalidate the `COPY . .` layer whenever a developer builds.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
transcription_service

# Not inputs to any image build. Excluded so they neither bloat the context nor
# invalidate the `COPY . .` layer (and every workspace build below it) when they
# change. `scribear.wiki` is a sibling wiki checkout some clones symlink here.
lumen
scribear.wiki

# Fixture audio: `speech` is a build input (the monitoring-sidecar image copies
# it in for the synthetic canary), the rest is integration-test material only.
test_audio_files/*
!test_audio_files/speech
